    "body": "fixes #41921\n\nwhen native autocomplete is scanning with `completeopt=menuone,noselect`, the completion loop was deleting and reinserting the unchanged original text while searching. that transient edit increments `b:changedtick` and marks the buffer modified even when the user never types or accepts a candidate.\n\nthis skips those temporary buffer mutations for the no-insert autocomplete path while preserving completion state/extmarks, and adds a functional regression that waits for the popup to become visible and verifies the buffer text, `&modified`, and `b:changedtick` all remain unchanged.\n\nvalidation:\n- focused functional regression passes\n- `git diff --check` clean",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-18T04:44:52Z",
